  = must: execute IR5-S01 before creating authority display contracts, fixtures, implementation activation plans, executable surface code, adapter code, dependency changes, or generated outputs
  = must: run completed-work review after each IR5 slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts current assumptions
  = must: reject any output that promotes surface state, adapter state, chat state, terminal output, IRC logs, Matrix events, web events, Langflow diagrams, Codex state, generated traces, or generated reports to source authority

